WEBVTT

01:41.000 --> 01:42.649
MOTLEY HEROES
I used the thermography from

01:42.650 --> 01:43.919
MOTLEY HEROES
the artificial satellite Shoji Peeper

01:43.920 --> 01:46.960
to check the number of monsters
inside the enemy's hideout.

01:47.450 --> 01:50.419
Thermal readings show that
there appear to be 500 monsters.

01:50.420 --> 01:51.589
If you do the simple math,

01:51.590 --> 01:54.219
that means each of us has to
take down over 60 monsters.

01:54.220 --> 01:57.429
The only concern would be the strength
of the enemy's top-level monsters.

01:57.430 --> 01:59.809
We now know that Centichoro,
who appeared the other day,

01:59.810 --> 02:02.729
was also working for
the Monster Association,

02:02.730 --> 02:05.399
so we should assume that they have
several other monsters

02:05.400 --> 02:07.899
at threat-level Demon or even Dragon.

02:07.900 --> 02:13.019
I was guarding the headquarters,
so I only fought one parasite.

02:13.020 --> 02:15.449
What about you guys
who were fighting out there?

02:15.450 --> 02:16.869
Were they strong?

02:16.870 --> 02:19.469
It felt like a real mixed bag.

02:19.470 --> 02:22.999
Most of them weren't much,
but there were a few really nasty ones,

02:23.000 --> 02:25.329
and even I had some close calls.

02:25.330 --> 02:26.999
CRACKING
Now that I've learned to accept the pain,

02:27.000 --> 02:29.309
Now that I've learned to accept the pain,

02:29.310 --> 02:30.299
it won't be a problem.

02:30.300 --> 02:33.509
Is it true that Drive Knight
got taken out?

02:33.510 --> 02:34.630
I don't know...

02:35.000 --> 02:37.179
He tortured a monster
and was the first to discover

02:37.180 --> 02:41.679
that their hideout was in City Z,
so he went to investigate.

02:41.680 --> 02:44.099
But we haven't heard from him since.

02:44.100 --> 02:46.440
So he was taken out, huh?

02:46.770 --> 02:49.479
He's got a cyborg body,

02:49.480 --> 02:51.899
so it doesn't necessarily
mean that he's dead.

02:51.900 --> 02:55.199
Maybe his parts were destroyed,
and he can't move or send a signal,

02:55.200 --> 02:57.820
so he's lying low somewhere
just waiting to be rescued.

02:58.480 --> 03:00.330
Let's hope so...

03:00.910 --> 03:05.749
What this means is, any of us
could end up like Drive Knight.

03:05.750 --> 03:07.499
So don't let your guard down.

03:07.500 --> 03:08.789
Stay sharp.

03:08.790 --> 03:11.669
I doubt they can defeat me.

03:11.670 --> 03:15.479
They'll strike without mercy
the minute we run into them.

03:15.480 --> 03:19.469
Of course, even if a monster
tries to negotiate,

03:19.470 --> 03:21.059
we do not need to respond.

03:21.060 --> 03:24.559
That's right.
Showing mercy will get you killed.

03:24.560 --> 03:27.199
Can I say something?
Among the Monster Association,

03:27.200 --> 03:31.020
there are also young men who were
tricked and turned into monsters.

03:31.440 --> 03:33.759
I want to save those guys.

03:33.760 --> 03:37.490
If you see monsters in prison uniforms,
let me deal with them.

03:37.830 --> 03:40.589
An old friend of mine turned
into a monster too,

03:40.590 --> 03:42.450
so I had no choice but to slash him.

03:42.860 --> 03:45.959
Is there any way to save those
who've been monsterized?

03:45.960 --> 03:49.249
I plan on trying a combo of Angel Hug
and Awakening Deep Kiss

03:49.250 --> 03:52.039
to see if they can snap out of it.

03:52.040 --> 03:54.599
I see...
Okay then... Sorry I asked.

03:54.600 --> 03:55.969
Let's get back to the topic.

03:55.970 --> 03:59.719
The boss, Monster King Orochi,
and the strategist, Gyoro-Gyoro,

03:59.720 --> 04:01.929
are without a doubt
threat level-Dragon.

04:01.930 --> 04:06.769
Yeah, they're strong enough
to command this many monsters.

04:06.770 --> 04:09.899
We should avoid one-on-one fights
where possible.

04:09.900 --> 04:12.979
Fine, I'll take down the final boss.

04:12.980 --> 04:17.779
You guys handle the small fry
that get in my way, okay?

04:17.780 --> 04:19.609
Hey, don't make decisions
for everyone.

04:19.610 --> 04:22.049
So you're saying
you wanna fight the final boss?

04:22.050 --> 04:23.449
- Shut her up.
- I'm doing this for

04:23.450 --> 04:24.699
- This is pointless.
- you wimps.

04:24.700 --> 04:26.360
Now, now, you two...

04:26.920 --> 04:29.369
This is why I hate
managing Class-S heroes.

04:29.370 --> 04:33.339
We're not here to direct traffic.

04:33.340 --> 04:36.169
This is a hostage rescue mission.

04:36.170 --> 04:38.010
Monster hunting is only a bonus.

04:38.440 --> 04:41.299
Don't forget about that, Tornado.

04:41.300 --> 04:45.110
You'd better not launch an attack
that'll wipe out the entire hideout.

04:45.890 --> 04:48.349
The underground is quite vast and deep.

04:48.350 --> 04:49.639
Even with my investigation,

04:49.640 --> 04:53.809
I can't pinpoint the exact location
of the boss in the hideout.

04:53.810 --> 04:56.819
If you run into something,
whether it be a small fry or the boss,

04:56.820 --> 04:58.399
a fight is unavoidable.

04:58.400 --> 05:01.029
Anyone who encounters them
must take them out.

05:01.030 --> 05:04.289
If we'd known the boss's location or
where the hostages were ahead of time,

05:04.290 --> 05:06.199
we could've done this
with far fewer people.

05:06.200 --> 05:10.080
Why do you think we've been
waiting around for everyone to gather?

05:10.590 --> 05:14.379
That much should be obvious
if you'd just think a little...

05:14.380 --> 05:16.569
Instead of always relying
on your psychic powers,

05:16.570 --> 05:18.629
how about using your head
once in a while?

05:18.630 --> 05:21.570
Stop, stop! That's enough!

05:22.130 --> 05:22.800
Hey.

05:23.210 --> 05:26.429
You guys... I was wondering
why you weren't in the waiting room.

05:26.430 --> 05:29.609
I'm on the team, yet here you are,
having a secret meeting without me.

05:29.610 --> 05:30.769
What's the meaning of this?

05:30.770 --> 05:32.450
Amai Mask!

05:33.230 --> 05:36.409
We weren't trying
to exclude you or anything.

05:36.410 --> 05:38.649
We first wanted to discuss it
among Class-S heroes.

05:38.650 --> 05:40.619
Why only Class-S?

05:40.620 --> 05:43.239
There are other members on
the team like me, right?

05:43.240 --> 05:44.530
Um, well...

05:44.920 --> 05:48.369
Everyone below Class-S is going
to be assigned to surface backup.

05:48.370 --> 05:50.829
I knew he would complain,

05:50.830 --> 05:53.660
so I was going to tell him
at the last minute.

05:54.170 --> 05:58.749
How can I explain this
without hurting his pride?

05:58.750 --> 06:01.419
Why? Because we all hate you.

06:01.420 --> 06:02.549
No, that's not true.

06:02.550 --> 06:05.140
You're making it worse, Tornado!

06:05.260 --> 06:08.889
Me assigned to surface standby?
Care to explain yourself?

06:08.890 --> 06:12.769
Yes, the attack team
goes underground

06:12.770 --> 06:15.839
and the support team stays above ground.
We split up into two teams.

06:15.840 --> 06:18.859
We wanted to utilize
your leadership skills

06:18.860 --> 06:22.029
and have you take command
of the support team, Amai Mask.

06:22.030 --> 06:25.159
We'll be the only ones
attacking underground.

06:25.160 --> 06:27.660
Deal with any monsters
we miss behind us.

06:28.060 --> 06:30.699
But I'll be bringing my disciples along.

06:30.700 --> 06:32.789
Twenty more pizzas, please.

06:32.790 --> 06:35.229
Don't stuff yourself before battle.

06:35.230 --> 06:37.460
Get protein instead, Pig God.

06:37.850 --> 06:40.499
No. I can't trust you guys
to handle it by yourselves.

06:40.500 --> 06:41.919
I'm going in too.

06:41.920 --> 06:43.419
I knew he'd say that.

06:43.420 --> 06:45.839
Do I have to spell it out for you?

06:45.840 --> 06:49.309
This fight is way out of your league.

06:49.310 --> 06:50.599
You're out of the lineup!

06:50.600 --> 06:52.639
Child Emperor,
you don't seem to understand.

06:52.640 --> 06:55.439
- Hey! Don't ignore me!
- If you want to utilize my leadership,

06:55.440 --> 06:58.559
then the Class-S heroes
should be under my command.

06:58.560 --> 07:00.959
- Us, under your command?
- Pretending not to hear me?!

07:00.960 --> 07:02.999
Keep the joke to just your name.

07:03.000 --> 07:06.409
You just want the credit?
Fine, take mine.

07:06.410 --> 07:08.319
But follow Child Emperor's orders.

07:08.320 --> 07:10.579
This isn't the time
to be holding each other back.

07:10.580 --> 07:11.579
That's right!

07:11.580 --> 07:14.709
You shouldn't be putting on perfume
before a battle, you idiot!

07:14.710 --> 07:17.799
We're about to face
an army of monsters.

07:17.800 --> 07:20.039
This isn't the time to be
dragging each other down.

07:20.040 --> 07:23.209
- Zombieman, why are you immortal?
- You smell! Change your name!

07:23.210 --> 07:24.170
It's creepy.

07:24.520 --> 07:27.429
Maybe you're actually a monster.

07:27.430 --> 07:28.509
What'd you just say?

07:28.510 --> 07:33.479
You're ranked Class S based
solely on your combat ability,

07:33.480 --> 07:35.769
but your true identity is questionable.

07:35.770 --> 07:39.149
Can we really trust that
you're on our side?

07:39.150 --> 07:42.439
Hey now, stop pushing him.

07:42.440 --> 07:44.989
This isn't right.
Heroes shouldn't be fighting each other.

07:44.990 --> 07:47.779
Yeah, you're supposed to be
a pro hero, and yet...

07:47.780 --> 07:48.819
What the heck?

07:48.820 --> 07:53.489
If you've gotta problem,
forget the battle and go sing alone.

07:53.490 --> 07:56.869
You Class-S heroes acting
like you're above it all.

07:56.870 --> 07:58.499
Your arrogance has gone too far.

07:58.500 --> 08:01.209
You have a bad rep
in the Association.

08:01.210 --> 08:04.169
It doesn't look like
you're giving your best.

08:04.170 --> 08:07.379
Oh, and five more liters of cola, please.

08:07.380 --> 08:10.849
Aren't you forgetting the responsibility
that comes with power?

08:10.850 --> 08:11.969
Wait a sec!

08:11.970 --> 08:14.639
Why are you working as
an idol on the side?

08:14.640 --> 08:15.499
That's ridiculous.

08:15.500 --> 08:18.549
You call yourself Handsome Kamen,
but you're not even that good-looking!

08:18.550 --> 08:19.899
Do you get that?

08:19.900 --> 08:21.559
C-Calm down.

08:21.560 --> 08:24.229
If you piss off Amai Mask,
the media will tear you apart.

08:24.230 --> 08:25.070
It'll be trouble.

08:25.420 --> 08:30.199
You Class-S heroes only get to exist
because you're kept under control.

08:30.200 --> 08:34.409
Otherwise, you're just dangerous
individuals with high combat power.

08:34.410 --> 08:37.199
So this time,
I'll put you to good use.

08:37.200 --> 08:39.000
Follow my orders.

08:40.790 --> 08:44.549
A master-servant relationship with
an assertive handsome guy.

08:44.550 --> 08:46.549
Not bad, but troubling...

08:46.550 --> 08:49.509
Why not try
and make us obey by force?

08:49.510 --> 08:51.380
If you think you can.

08:51.990 --> 08:54.050
Do you think I can't?

08:56.520 --> 08:58.679
Hey, this is no joke.

08:58.680 --> 09:00.479
Stop that murderous glare, Flash.

09:00.480 --> 09:02.039
It's up to him.

09:02.040 --> 09:03.729
If he interferes with the operation...

09:03.730 --> 09:05.860
Mr. King has arrived!

09:06.690 --> 09:11.160
RUMBLE RUMBLE

09:11.480 --> 09:13.739
King, what perfect timing.

09:13.740 --> 09:15.739
You'll be under my command too.

09:15.740 --> 09:18.869
Why are you so filthy?
And you stink too.

09:18.870 --> 09:23.169
Oh yeah, I was brought here
right after I got home,

09:23.170 --> 09:25.119
so I didn't have a chance to change.

09:25.120 --> 09:27.839
Oh dang,
this is gonna leave a stain.

09:27.840 --> 09:30.969
Why were you so late?
Where have you been?

09:30.970 --> 09:32.719
How did you get like that?

09:32.720 --> 09:34.219
What's with the interrogation?

09:34.220 --> 09:36.560
I never did like this guy.

09:36.910 --> 09:41.100
Well, it's not really anything
worth mentioning.

09:41.560 --> 09:43.499
But I was in City Z...

09:43.500 --> 09:44.859
- having hot pot...
- Mr. King was...

09:44.860 --> 09:48.849
fighting alone near the enemy hideout
in City Z all night!

09:48.850 --> 09:49.899
Huh?

09:49.900 --> 09:52.149
The stains on his clothes
are the monsters' blood.

09:52.150 --> 09:55.239
As proof, the splatters
are only on the front.

09:55.240 --> 09:59.199
Outnumbered, he drained his strength
and pulled back.

09:59.200 --> 10:01.709
That's when we found him
and escorted him here!

10:01.710 --> 10:05.709
Why do these people always get
the wrong idea and spread it around?

10:05.710 --> 10:08.960
Fighting nonstop... all by himself...

10:10.490 --> 10:11.919
Impressive.

10:11.920 --> 10:17.169
Hmph... Your decisiveness,
your fearless resolve.

10:17.170 --> 10:18.969
I have to hand it to you.

10:18.970 --> 10:21.519
Apparently, there are some
decent Class-S heroes.

10:21.520 --> 10:23.689
Quarreling among ourselves is pointless.

10:23.690 --> 10:25.900
For King's sake, I'll back down.

10:28.320 --> 10:29.899
But I'm still on the attack team.

10:29.900 --> 10:31.069
That's non-negotiable.

10:31.070 --> 10:33.860
Incredible.
He's not backing down at all.

10:34.240 --> 10:39.119
King, you can't fight
the enemy alone.

10:39.120 --> 10:39.829
No...

10:39.830 --> 10:44.289
Just like you, Drive Knight went alone
to investigate the ghost town,

10:44.290 --> 10:46.540
and since then,
we've lost all contact with him.

10:46.960 --> 10:50.129
Who knows what kind of threat
might be lurking there?

10:50.130 --> 10:51.690
Let's all fight together.

10:53.970 --> 10:54.800
Sure...!

11:02.470 --> 11:04.440
The support team has assembled.

11:04.810 --> 11:06.200
It's time to depart.

11:08.650 --> 11:10.359
This is a critical moment.

11:10.360 --> 11:11.360
Yeah.

11:11.820 --> 11:13.779
Are you planning to go to the scene?

11:13.780 --> 11:16.490
As the one responsible,
I'll see this through to the end.

11:16.840 --> 11:20.609
I've underestimated you.
Who knew you had such backbone.

11:20.610 --> 11:23.619
I thought you were just driven
by ambition for promotion.

11:23.620 --> 11:26.199
Hmph. You're not wrong there.

11:26.200 --> 11:29.460
Defeating the Monster Association
will guarantee a promotion...

11:32.200 --> 11:34.420
And my name will go down in history.

11:40.920 --> 11:44.389
Thank you all for coming.
I'm Sekingal.

11:44.390 --> 11:45.679
And I'm Sitch.

11:45.680 --> 11:48.979
Is everyone clear on today's mission?

11:48.980 --> 11:53.529
Yes, sir! Today's event is
to support Class-S heroes.

11:53.530 --> 11:55.239
Um... okay...

11:55.240 --> 11:56.710
Event?

11:57.800 --> 12:01.409
Specifically, you will eliminate
any monsters who escape,

12:01.410 --> 12:04.159
secure evacuation routes,
and protect the child.

12:04.160 --> 12:07.579
Once the Class-S heroes storm in
and rescue the hostage,

12:07.580 --> 12:09.959
you will safely escort him back
to headquarters.

12:09.960 --> 12:12.169
That is the most important mission.

12:12.170 --> 12:13.839
Can I say something?

12:13.840 --> 12:14.799
What is it?

12:14.800 --> 12:18.089
We're risking our necks diving
straight into enemy territory

12:18.090 --> 12:20.429
without knowing what's waiting for us.

12:20.430 --> 12:25.429
At the very least,
I want my hero ranking bumped up.

12:25.430 --> 12:27.030
Otherwise, it ain't worth it.

12:28.620 --> 12:30.349
Fine. I promise.

12:30.350 --> 12:31.920
All right!

12:32.520 --> 12:33.939
Well, Sitch?

12:33.940 --> 12:37.489
Looks like humanity's protectors
are stronger than ever, right?

12:37.490 --> 12:39.239
Uh... yeah...

12:39.240 --> 12:40.890
Excuse me, Mr. Sitch...

12:43.280 --> 12:44.450
What?!

12:48.370 --> 12:52.879
Yo, Sitch.
I dropped my portable phone somewhere.

12:52.880 --> 12:55.499
Sorry, but can you give me a new one?

12:55.500 --> 12:59.629
O-Okay. Got it.
I'll get you one right away.

12:59.630 --> 13:01.759
Remember, Sitch.

13:01.760 --> 13:03.850
Send him back
without telling him anything.

13:04.240 --> 13:07.519
And about Garou's hideout...

13:07.520 --> 13:09.829
Have you gotten any new information?

13:09.830 --> 13:13.230
I imagine he's still with
the monster group.

13:13.590 --> 13:16.779
No, nothing new.

13:16.780 --> 13:18.279
I see.

13:18.280 --> 13:19.549
Silverfang.

13:19.550 --> 13:20.199
Hm?

13:20.200 --> 13:23.429
Why did you let Garou get away?

13:23.430 --> 13:26.160
Did a monster really intervene?

13:26.540 --> 13:29.870
Are you saying
I let him go on purpose?

13:31.120 --> 13:35.090
Sorry... There's so much going on,
I'm a bit confused.

13:35.460 --> 13:38.839
I'll have a staff member
bring you a new transmitter.

13:38.840 --> 13:40.760
Please wait here.

13:43.050 --> 13:45.219
They don't trust you.

13:45.220 --> 13:49.270
Maybe they think you held back
and failed to finish him off.

13:49.600 --> 13:51.670
I didn't hold back.

13:52.730 --> 13:55.229
Good.
Looks like no one's following me.

13:55.230 --> 13:57.939
For now, I'll hide in this room.

13:57.940 --> 14:00.189
But how am I gonna get out of here?

14:00.190 --> 14:01.570
What're you doing?

14:02.150 --> 14:04.069
Why are you here, Bang?

14:04.070 --> 14:08.120
I had some business to tend to.
Why are you here?

14:08.440 --> 14:10.999
There was an emergency summons
for Class-S heroes

14:11.000 --> 14:13.369
and I was brought here too...

14:13.370 --> 14:16.339
What? No one told me.

14:16.340 --> 14:19.879
Oops... I wasn't supposed to
tell Bang about this...

14:19.880 --> 14:23.969
Oh come on...
You and I shared a hot pot together.

14:23.970 --> 14:25.350
Spill it.

14:26.850 --> 14:30.309
King's taking a long time
in the bathroom.

14:30.310 --> 14:32.269
His engine was revving pretty hard,

14:32.270 --> 14:35.000
so maybe he's just trying
to focus on his own.

14:36.270 --> 14:39.569
You're storming
the Monster Association's hideout?

14:39.570 --> 14:41.840
So that's what's happening...

14:42.540 --> 14:47.470
And yet, both Genos and I were left out.
I guess they don't trust us.

14:48.080 --> 14:52.099
They took a child hostage?
Damn brutes.

14:52.100 --> 14:56.380
We were so focused on tracking Garou,
we didn't even catch the news.

14:56.750 --> 15:01.299
Does Saitama know that
the enemy hideout is in the ghost town?

15:01.300 --> 15:02.919
No, I don't think so...

15:02.920 --> 15:05.589
If he knew, I'm sure he would've
already gone by himself.

15:05.590 --> 15:09.579
From here, the team will move
into the ruins of City Z,

15:09.580 --> 15:12.519
each entering from their own route.

15:12.520 --> 15:14.310
But there's something
I want to ask you.

15:14.650 --> 15:16.520
Silverfang, Bomb.

15:16.940 --> 15:19.569
How about we take Caped Baldy
and Demon Cyborg along,

15:19.570 --> 15:23.039
and secretly slip in
through my entry route?

15:23.040 --> 15:25.990
It would go against
the Association's orders though...

15:26.360 --> 15:28.409
Garou will be there, right?

15:28.410 --> 15:30.160
We'll go with you.

15:31.620 --> 15:33.109
All right.

15:33.110 --> 15:36.039
Just like yesterday,
we'll meet up at Saitama's place.

15:36.040 --> 15:37.579
Okay.

15:37.580 --> 15:39.670
See you later.

15:40.960 --> 15:44.780
Oh, thank god.
What a relief.

15:45.300 --> 15:49.509
Oh, King's back.
Did something happen?

15:49.510 --> 15:51.679
No, no problem at all.

15:51.680 --> 15:54.309
The King Engine has stopped.

15:54.310 --> 15:56.190
He must've sharpened his focus.

15:57.230 --> 15:58.769
All right, let's head out.

15:58.770 --> 16:00.440
Is everyone ready?

16:00.900 --> 16:02.070
Let's go!

16:11.830 --> 16:14.869
I was summoned to join
the assault team,

16:14.870 --> 16:17.619
but for some reason,
they pulled me out at the last minute.

16:17.620 --> 16:19.790
I was told to stay out of this matter.

16:20.330 --> 16:23.249
I bet Tornado's the one
who shut me out.

16:23.250 --> 16:24.249
No!

16:24.250 --> 16:27.249
She will never acknowledge me,
will she?

16:27.250 --> 16:30.259
I also have a personal score
to settle with the Monster Association.

16:30.260 --> 16:34.100
How dare they humiliate me
in front of my sister like that.

16:35.390 --> 16:38.729
Steady point-gathering
and continuous activity

16:38.730 --> 16:41.149
used to be
the Blizzard Bunch's strength.

16:41.150 --> 16:45.230
But because of them,
our operations have been put on hold.

16:51.320 --> 16:53.079
I'll get my revenge.

16:53.080 --> 16:55.540
With the power of
the New Blizzard Bunch.

16:59.290 --> 17:02.789
I gave Dr. Kuseno a hard time
with my unreasonable request,

17:02.790 --> 17:07.129
but following Master's advice,
I had him increase my power even more.

17:07.130 --> 17:10.379
This upgrade is pretty reckless.

17:10.380 --> 17:13.879
A terribly unbalanced,
attack-specialized boost.

17:13.880 --> 17:18.809
I boosted the horsepower to the limit
without reducing the armor.

17:18.810 --> 17:22.109
You'll have to fight while controlling
that power yourself.

17:22.110 --> 17:27.109
If you go full power, the parts will
exceed their endurance and break.

17:27.110 --> 17:31.780
It's strictly a last resort...
Ten seconds is the limit.

17:32.240 --> 17:34.779
Any more than that,
your body won't withstand.

17:34.780 --> 17:36.959
If your energy core explodes,

17:36.960 --> 17:40.230
even though you are a cyborg,
you could die.

17:40.790 --> 17:45.290
You got that, Genos?
Full power will only last 10 seconds.

17:45.690 --> 17:47.590
Don't forget that.

17:50.380 --> 17:51.090
Oh.

17:54.010 --> 17:56.009
What do you want now?

17:56.010 --> 17:58.889
Don't think you can visit
whenever you like.

17:58.890 --> 18:02.519
Oh, please. You're around all
the time too, aren't you?

18:02.520 --> 18:04.350
You don't get to complain.

18:04.770 --> 18:08.169
I have the right as Master's disciple.

18:08.170 --> 18:10.819
Besides, I'm paying
my share of the rent.

18:10.820 --> 18:15.109
Rent? Saitama isn't even
the owner of this apartment.

18:15.110 --> 18:16.989
He's just living here
without permission.

18:16.990 --> 18:18.830
You're getting scammed.

18:19.490 --> 18:23.459
Anyway, haven't you heard anything
from the Association yet?

18:23.460 --> 18:24.880
They've already contacted me.

18:25.540 --> 18:28.709
One of the executive's son
has been taken hostage,

18:28.710 --> 18:31.299
so I feel like they should have
made a move already.

18:31.300 --> 18:33.839
But maybe they haven't
located the hideout?

18:33.840 --> 18:37.800
If we knew, Master Saitama would've
wiped them all out by now.

18:38.310 --> 18:40.219
I'm back from getting repairs.

18:40.220 --> 18:41.769
We're here, Saitama.

18:41.770 --> 18:44.270
We can finally have a strategy meeting...

18:45.150 --> 18:47.229
Oh? He's not here.

18:47.230 --> 18:50.280
But the discount sale he was waiting for
is the day after tomorrow.

18:51.030 --> 18:52.299
Did he tell you anything?

18:52.300 --> 18:55.340
His hero suit is gone too.
Maybe something happened.

18:56.240 --> 18:59.989
Yo! We're back, Saitama.

18:59.990 --> 19:01.799
Master is not here.

19:01.800 --> 19:05.020
Hm? Not here?
That's too bad.

19:05.520 --> 19:09.849
We were just about to raid
the monsters' hideout with King.

19:09.850 --> 19:13.129
What? So you've located
the Monster Association's hideout?

19:13.130 --> 19:15.759
Apparently, it's right nearby.

19:15.760 --> 19:17.640
Right under our noses,
as they say.

19:18.600 --> 19:20.759
You're coming too, won't you, Genos?

19:20.760 --> 19:22.060
Of course.

19:25.270 --> 19:28.110
Phew, I somehow managed to get out.

19:28.980 --> 19:30.980
Oh, there you are King.

19:31.660 --> 19:34.230
Oh... Hi...

19:35.770 --> 19:37.319
Looks like everyone's here.

19:37.320 --> 19:39.239
Saitama's not here though.

19:39.240 --> 19:40.829
What? No way!

19:40.830 --> 19:43.789
But we don't have any time left
before the attack begins...

19:43.790 --> 19:45.919
RUMBLE RUMBLE
So what do we do, King?

19:45.920 --> 19:48.129
RUMBLE RUMBLE
Do we wait for Saitama to come back?

19:48.130 --> 19:50.039
RUMBLE RUMBLE
Or do we go in without him?

19:50.040 --> 19:53.000
RUMBLE RUMBLE

19:53.380 --> 19:55.239
We wait for Saitama.

19:55.240 --> 19:57.149
If this is going to be
an all-out battle,

19:57.150 --> 19:59.429
we need Saitama's strength.

19:59.430 --> 20:00.969
I gotta hand it to you, King.

20:00.970 --> 20:03.350
You already made plans
behind the scenes.

20:03.690 --> 20:05.889
If we're going,
then we all go.

20:05.890 --> 20:09.559
All of the members of
this New Blizzard Bunch together, right?

20:09.560 --> 20:11.000
So what should we do?

20:11.850 --> 20:15.029
Hey you! Don't ignore me!

20:15.030 --> 20:20.280
Hey, are you listening!
Look at me! Hey!

20:20.620 --> 20:24.909
King's delay only increases the burden
on the other Class-S heroes.

20:24.910 --> 20:26.370
You guys go on ahead.

20:26.710 --> 20:28.519
I will wait for Master.

20:28.520 --> 20:30.329
Once he returns,
we'll join the raid.

20:30.330 --> 20:32.169
Sounds like a plan.

20:32.170 --> 20:34.549
What? We're going without Saitama?

20:34.550 --> 20:36.090
Are you serious?

20:36.850 --> 20:38.379
All right, let's go.

20:38.380 --> 20:40.589
Let's finish this before sundown.

20:40.590 --> 20:44.099
Follow me!
The New Blizzard Bunch, head out!

20:44.100 --> 20:46.019
RUMBLE RUMBLE

20:46.020 --> 20:47.980
RUMBLE RUMBLE
I'm not sure about this...

20:51.100 --> 20:54.400
Saitama, where did you go?

22:31.790 --> 22:32.830
We've arrived.

22:36.790 --> 22:39.629
Hm? Where's King?

22:39.630 --> 22:41.309
He should've been at the rear.

22:41.310 --> 22:43.430
I saw him running off.

22:43.780 --> 22:47.719
I'm gonna get to my position early,
so don't worry about me.

22:47.720 --> 22:51.079
Everyone should stick
to the scheduled timing for the assault.

22:51.080 --> 22:52.269
That's what he said.

22:52.270 --> 22:56.519
He acts on his own like it's nothing.

22:56.520 --> 22:58.850
Why didn't he tell me directly?

22:59.730 --> 23:01.989
Am I still being treated like a kid?

23:01.990 --> 23:07.199
He acts fast.
That's just how he is.

23:07.200 --> 23:10.659
I was hoping to see King
in action up close.

23:10.660 --> 23:11.869
What a shame.

23:11.870 --> 23:14.709
He has his own way
of doing things.

23:14.710 --> 23:15.709
Yeah.

23:15.710 --> 23:16.420
Hey...

23:17.260 --> 23:18.920
Check out what's ahead.

23:19.840 --> 23:22.419
Looks like they're rolling out
the welcome party for us.

23:22.420 --> 23:24.840
Whoa... They just keep showing up.

23:25.240 --> 23:28.300
Master Atomic,
I sense them behind us too.

23:28.720 --> 23:31.060
Not just behind us.

23:39.400 --> 23:41.480
An old rag...?

23:45.830 --> 23:47.780
Well, well...

23:48.120 --> 23:49.569
Oh my...

23:49.570 --> 23:53.409
I heard the Hero Association was
sending in its full fighting force,

23:53.410 --> 23:55.160
but this is it?

23:55.910 --> 24:00.920
COUNTERSTRIKE
